<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee firms on dollar, weaker on pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee firms on dollar, weaker on pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee firmed against the dollar but weakened versus the pound on Thursday, foreign exchange dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee traded at a mean commercial rate of 20.2715 against the dollar from 20.2835 on Wednesday. On the pound, the rupee was fixed at a mean of 31.603 from 31.523 on Wednesday.</p>
